WEBVTT

46:30.898 --> 46:32.941
(CROWD CHEERING)

46:38.572 --> 46:41.158
Gods, who's that?

46:41.283 --> 46:43.619
LITTLEFINGER: Ser Gregor Clegane.

46:43.744 --> 46:46.622
They call him the Mountain.

46:48.290 --> 46:50.918
The Hound's older brother.

46:51.043 --> 46:54.213
- And his opponent?
- LITTLEFINGER: Ser Hugh of the Vale.

46:54.338 --> 46:56.173
He was Jon Arryn's squire.

46:56.298 --> 46:57.841
Look how far he's come.

46:57.966 --> 47:02.221
Yes, yes, enough of
the bloody pomp. Have at him!
